        content: `<p><strong>MaiHoonNa Eldercare Private Limited</strong></p><p><em>Caring for the people who cared for us</em></p><p><strong>Privacy Policy</strong></p><p><em>Last updated: [insert date on publish]</em></p><h1><strong>1. Information We Collect</strong></h1><p>To provide safe and personalized elder care services, MaiHoonNa collects information including:</p><ul><li><strong>Account Information: </strong>Full name, phone number, email address, and age of subscribers and beneficiaries.</li><li><strong>Service Addresses: </strong>House/flat number, landmark, area, city, and pincode for accurate companion dispatch.</li><li><strong>Emergency Contacts: </strong>Names, relationships, and emergency phone numbers designated by family members.</li><li><strong>Health &amp; Activity Notes: </strong>Daily wellness check-in summaries, visit feedback, and activity logs.</li></ul><h1><strong>2. How We Use Your Data</strong></h1><p>We use your data solely to:</p><ul><li>Authenticate your login and verify mobile OTPs securely without requiring passwords.</li><li>Coordinate, dispatch, and track Care Mitra senior visits.</li><li>Deliver real-time visit reports and emergency SOS notifications to family members.</li><li>Maintain safety and service compliance across all visits.</li></ul><h1><strong>3. Privacy Protection &amp; Non-Disclosure</strong></h1><p>MaiHoonNa <strong>does not sell, rent, or trade</strong> your personal or health data to third-party marketing companies or advertisers. Data is stored on secure cloud servers with end-to-end encryption in transit (TLS 1.3) and at rest.</p><h1><strong>4. Account &amp; Data Deletion Rights</strong></h1><p>You retain complete ownership of your data. You may request profile updates or permanent account deletion at any time directly through the mobile app settings or by writing to <a href="mailto:care@maihoonna.in">care@maihoonna.in</a>.</p><p><em>MaiHoonNa Eldercare Private Limited  |  care@maihoonna.com  |  www.maihoonna.com  |  Gurugram, Haryana</em></p>`
